# Claude Code Overlay (example)

Read `AGENTS.md` first — it is the source of truth for how to work in this
workspace. This file adds only what is specific to Claude Code.

**Durable principles never live here.** If something in this file reads like a
principle, move it to `AGENTS.md`. Vendor files are Post-its; `AGENTS.md` is
the entryway sign.

